<title>USA: Federal-Mogul closing Phoenix facility.</title>
<headline>Federal-Mogul closing Phoenix facility.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTHFIELD, Mich. 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Federal-Mogul Corp said Wednesday it will close its customer support in Phoenix by October 1 and consolidate those functions at its headquarters in Southfield, Mich.</p>
<p>There are about 40 full-time and 20 part-time employees in Phoenix.  Federal-Mogul said it anticipates adding 30 to 40 positions in Southfield.</p>
<p>The company manufactures and distributes a range of non-discretionary parts primarily for automobiles, light truks, heavy trucks and farm and construction vehicles.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
